{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1589700/extras/8240c32bd40766c2b9eebe84ac7c94a6.poster.avif?t=1767604159\" width=600 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1589700/extras/8240c32bd40766c2b9eebe84ac7c94a6.webm?t=1767604159\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1589700/extras/8240c32bd40766c2b9eebe84ac7c94a6.mp4?t=1767604159\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Explore</strong> an world years after humans have died out. Playing as a <strong>Morphite</strong>, new resin based lifeforms, venture out from the safety of your Cradle into a wild <strong>hazardous levels</strong> to <strong>collect rubbish resources</strong>.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1589700/extras/aab9592ca1e1ac520e403525dfb660a2.webp?t=1767604159\" width=600 height=40 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1589700/extras/5c23bbc52133f95aead858ee27bcb6af.poster.avif?t=1767604159\" width=600 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1589700/extras/5c23bbc52133f95aead858ee27bcb6af.webm?t=1767604159\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1589700/extras/5c23bbc52133f95aead858ee27bcb6af.mp4?t=1767604159\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Craft &amp; Attach Forms</strong> to <strong>gain abilities</strong> that help you; explore, survive hazards, avoid creatures, help other players &amp; collect resources. Players can attach up to 4 forms at once.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1589700/extras/aab9592ca1e1ac520e403525dfb660a2.webp?t=1767604159\" width=600 height=40 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1589700/extras/d7d44e964369a528ca577bb0d5221ac9.poster.avif?t=1767604159\" width=600 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1589700/extras/d7d44e964369a528ca577bb0d5221ac9.webm?t=1767604159\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1589700/extras/d7d44e964369a528ca577bb0d5221ac9.mp4?t=1767604159\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Each level contains a different <strong>procedurally generated Hazard Dungeon</strong>, ensuring high replayability. Their level locations are fixed, while the puzzles, layout and hazards within are generated.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1589700/extras/aab9592ca1e1ac520e403525dfb660a2.webp?t=1767604159\" width=600 height=40 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1589700/extras/6f18f3fddf2758f0a57a6636e255d9bc.poster.avif?t=1767604159\" width=600 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1589700/extras/6f18f3fddf2758f0a57a6636e255d9bc.webm?t=1767604159\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1589700/extras/6f18f3fddf2758f0a57a6636e255d9bc.mp4?t=1767604159\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The world consists of a series of 7 levels, each with hazards prevent